    <string name="storage_title">Trace saves logs</string>
    <string name="storage_message">Trace creates the folder Download/Trace on the phone. It saves one file per day with all measurements and one with all events.\n\nAndroid does not remove the folder automatically when you uninstall the app. Use Settings → Remove the Trace folder before you uninstall.</string>
    <string name="storage_info_file">Trace saves one file per day in this folder:\n\ntrace-YYYY-MM-DD.csv: all measurements\ntrace-YYYY-MM-DD-handelser.csv: all anomalies and downgrades\n\nThe folder is not removed automatically when the app is uninstalled. Use Settings → Remove the Trace folder in the app, or delete the folder yourself.\n\nDeveloper: Claes Sundman S.N.C AB. For learning purpose only.\n</string>
